Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.50,0:20:56.87,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,She's super flashy and gaudy! It's rather suspicious!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.87,0:20:59.70,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,She seems like the phantom thief-da Vinci!
