Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.88,0:21:10.84,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Dear students,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.84,0:21:16.94,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I would like to introduce the \Nnew art teacher we have appointed.
