Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.97,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Yehellow!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.97,0:21:30.06,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I'm Kiki Ajimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.06,0:21:34.91,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,I'm your art teacher from here on out-da Vinci!
